Description: Enterprise Network Monitoring System
 NetMon v2 is a production-ready network monitoring system supporting
 SNMP v1/v2c/v3, ICMP ping, HTTP/HTTPS checks, syslog collection,
 and SNMP trap reception. Features include threshold-based alerting,
 LDAP authentication, and a React-based web interface.
